## Limitations

This is an educational language implementation, not a secure sandbox. It intentionally has no file, network, operating-system, or arbitrary Python execution instructions. The transpiler supports the same core language subset as the compiler. NovaScript functions, lists, classes and imports are not part of version 1.0.
